    <body>
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:0"/>praṇamya buddhān sasutān bhaktyā saṃpūjya śaktitaḥ |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:1"/>yac chīlaṃ bodhisattvānāṃ sarvadikkālabhāvinām ||1||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:2"/>nidhānaṃ sarvapuṇyānām āśayena pareṇa tat |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:3"/>saṃvarasthāt samādeyaṃ vijñāt pratibalād guroḥ ||2||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:4"/>tadā sadāpi sasutaiḥ samanvāhriyate jinaiḥ |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:5"/>kalyāṇāyaiva kalyāṇair manobhiḥ priyaputravat ||3||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:6"/>hitaṃ sukhañ ca kartavyaṃ duḥkham vā hitam eva yat |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:7"/>sukham apy ahitaṃ naiva pareṣām ātmano &#x27;pi vā ||4||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:8"/>āpattayaś catasro &#x27;sya pārājayikavan matāḥ |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:9"/>tīvrakleśasamutthānād bhaidikāḥ saṃvarasya yāḥ ||5||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:10"/>lābhasatkāragṛddhasya svotkarṣaparapaṃsane |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:11"/>adānaṃ duḥkhyanāthebhyo mātsaryād dhanadharmayoḥ ||6||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:12"/>parasya tāḍanaṃ krodhāt parato &#x27;nunayāgrahaḥ |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:13"/>mahāyānapratikṣpepaḥ saddharmābhāsadīpanam ||7||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:14"/>saṃvaraḥ punar ādeyo deśyā madhyāsravās triṣu |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:15"/>ekasyāpi puraḥ śeṣāḥ kliṣṭākliṣṭāḥ svacittavat ||8||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:16"/>tridhā ratnatraye &#x27;pūjā ... ...
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:17"/>... ... ... ||9||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:18"/>dkon mchog gsum la gsum mi mchod ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:19"/>&#x27;dod pa&#x27;i sems kyi rjes su &#x27;jug |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:20"/>rgan pa rnams la gus mi byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:21"/>dris pa la ni lan mi &#x27;debs ||9||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:22"/>mgron por bdag gir mi byed cing ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:23"/>gser la sogs pa len mi byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:24"/>chos &#x27;dod pa la sbyin mi byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:25"/>tshul khrims &#x27;chal rnams yal bar &#x27;dor ||10||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:26"/>... ... ... |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:27"/>sadayasyāśubhaṃ nāsti ... ||11|
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:28"/>pha rol dad phyir slob mi byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:29"/>sems can don la bya ba chung ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:30"/>snying brtser bcas na mi dge med ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:31"/>&#x27;tsho ba log pa dang du len ||11||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:32"/>&#x27;phyar nas rab tu rgod la sogs ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:33"/>&#x27;khor ba gcig (D167a) bu bgrod par sems ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:34"/>grags pa ma yin mi spong ba ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:35"/>nyon mongs bcas kyang chos mi byed ||12||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:36"/>gshe la lan du gshe la sogs ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:37"/>khros ba rnams ni yal bar &#x27;jog |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:38"/>pha rol shad kyis &#x27;chags pa spong ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:39"/>khro ba&#x27;i sems kyi rjes su &#x27;jug ||13||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:40"/>(D167a2) bsnyen bkur &#x27;dod phyir &#x27;khor rnams sdud ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:41"/>le lo la sogs sel mi byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:42"/>chags pas bre mo&#x27;i gtam la brten ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:43"/>ting nge &#x27;dzin gyi don mi tshol ||14||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:44"/>bsam gtan sgrib pa spong mi byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:45"/>bsam gtan ro la yon tan lta ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:46"/>nyan thos theg pa spong bar byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:47"/>rang tshul yod bzhin (D167a3) de la brtson ||15||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:48"/>brtson min phyi rol bstan bcos brtson ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:49"/>brtson par byas kyang de la dga&#x27; ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:50"/>theg pa chen po spong bar byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:51"/>bdag la stod cing gzhan la smod ||16||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:52"/>chos kyi don du &#x27;gro mi byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:53"/>de la smod cing yi ge brten ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:54"/>dgos pa&#x27;i grogs su &#x27;gro mi byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:55"/>nad pa&#x27;i (D167a4) rim gro bya ba spong ||17||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:56"/>sdug bsngal sel bar mi byed pa ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:57"/>bag med rnams la rigs mi ston ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:58"/>byams la lan du phan mi &#x27;dogs ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:59"/>gzhan gyi mya ngan bsang mi byed ||18||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:60"/>nor &#x27;dod pa la sbyin mi byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:61"/>&#x27;khor rnams kyi ni don mi byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:62"/>gzhan gyi blo dang mthun mi &#x27;jug ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:63"/>(D167a5) yon tan bsngags pa smra mi byed ||19||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:64"/>... ... ... |
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:65"/>nāpattiḥ śubhacittasya snehāc caiva dayāvataḥ ||20||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:66"/>rkyen du &#x27;tsham par tshar mi gcod ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:67"/>rdzu &#x27;phrul sdig la sogs pa mi byed ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:68"/>snying rjer ldan zhing byams phyir dang ||
<lb n="SA_T01_Candragomin_Bodhisattvasaṃvaraviṃśikā-Skt-verses-available-in-testimonia-thus-far_Li_2015:69"/>sems dge ba la nyes pa med ||20||
    </body>
